{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All Living Things</strong> is an animated art-book puzzle game inspired by <i>The Ripley Scroll</i>, a 15th-century alchemical manuscript. Solve 12 intricate visual puzzles, each reflecting a stage in the alchemical process. Select and sequence objects to create looping animations, guided by cryptic verse and symbolic imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HAND CRAFTED STOP-MOTION ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All Living Things </i>uses carefully made stop-motion animation for every in-game asset. As you solve puzzles you imbue images with charming animated vitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681490/extras/lion_00.gif?t=1747915853\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ALLEGORICAL IMAGES AND POETRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter puzzles inspired by real life alchemical emblems and historical visual language. Your journey will be aided by unique poems that inspire you to think lyrically and logically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681490/extras/GIF_16-05-2025_12-55-55.gif?t=1747915853\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNIQUE PUZZLE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All Living Things </i>introduces a unique visual puzzle mechanic that invites you to carefully observe mystical and natural processes in order to uncover the secrets behind cryptic hermetic emblems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681490/extras/puzzleexample.gif?t=1747915853\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY THE DEMO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo features the first three puzzles and serves as an early preview of the project. The full game is currently in development, with more complex puzzles to come....</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681490?t=1747915853","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681490?t=1747915853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681490/dcdb7bd0b72baff458e8146b3b0fa244fe979cab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747915853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681490/dcdb7bd0b72baff458e8146b3b0fa244fe979cab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747915853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All Living Things</strong> is an animated art-book puzzle game inspired by <i>The Ripley Scroll</i>, a 15th-century alchemical manuscript. Solve 12 intricate visual puzzles, each reflecting a stage in the alchemical process. Select and sequence objects to create looping animations, guided by cryptic verse and symbolic imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HAND CRAFTED STOP-MOTION ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All Living Things </i>uses carefully made stop-motion animation for every in-game asset. As you solve puzzles you imbue images with charming animated vitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681490/extras/lion_00.gif?t=1747915853\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ALLEGORICAL IMAGES AND POETRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter puzzles inspired by real life alchemical emblems and historical visual language. Your journey will be aided by unique poems that inspire 